  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a medium saucepan with boiling water and a pinch of salt.\n• Cook penne in boiling water over high heat until ‘al dente’, 12 mins.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2P / 1/2 cup for 4P), then drain and return to pan. Drizzle with a little olive oil to prevent sticking.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion.\n• Roughly chop tomato.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548a67c300963db7b424/step-71fd2e00.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add tomato & herb seasoning, chopped tomato and lentils and cook until fragrant, 2 mins.\n• Add passata, the salt, reserved pasta water, butter and brown sugar and cook until thickened, 1-2 mins. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548a67c300963db7b424/step-59ff1e10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• Add penne to frying pan with sauce and stir to combine. Transfer to a baking dish.\n• Sprinkle with shredded mozzarella.\n• Grill until cheese has melted, 5-8 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548a67c300963db7b424/step-cbe74320.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine rocket leaves and a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper.\n• Divide pasta bake between bowls. Serve with rocket.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6992548a67c300963db7b424/step-36fe0b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
